    feedback.f90:
    Many (~45) differences with respect to standard version
    copied as is from src_orig, as it seems OK to do so
    - IMPORTANT: the code required one crucial change to avoid a fatal bug!
    In subroutine 'feedbk', the calling signature of subroutine 'get3cubefather' (declared in  amr/nbors_utils.f90) changed:
    !  old: get3cubefather(ind_cell,nbors_father_cells,nbors_father_grids,ng,ilevel)
    ! new
      call get3cubefather(ind_cell,nbors_father_cells,ng,ilevel)
    The variable 'nbors_father_grids' is thus obsolete.
    There may be other crucial differences like this still, so better to update the feedback.f90 using the updated and patched files.
    - Enclosed call to subroutine 'flush(SNunit_out)' within
        if(SNdiagnostics)then
            flush(SNunit_out)
        endif


